        "title": "A good day to remember",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214888/A-good-day-to-remember",
        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://tjandamal.com/sac/page/000.html\">Shot and Chaser</a> is an emotional webcomic about a photographer and a storm chaser during the covid19 pandemic (first 5 pages mildly nsfw). From <a href=\"https://bigbigtruck.carrd.co/\">E.K. Weaver</a>, creator of the also-excellent <a href=\"https://tjandamal.com/\">TJ and Amal</a> (<a href=\"https://www.metafilter.com/213584/They-Kiss-In-Chapter-15\">previously</a>). Shot and Chaser is a return to the theme of two gay men in a car having feelings, with beautiful skies.<br/><br/>Shot and Chaser the webcomic is on hiatus until after <a href=\"https://us.macmillan.com/books/9781250421623/shotchaser/\">the print edition</a> is released on June 1st 2027, but the 210 pages on the website make up a complete first arc.\n\nSweet Abilene is a Shot and Chaser adult prequel/side story available in <a href=\"https://tjandamal.bigcartel.com/product/sweet-abilene-comic\">print</a>, or in <a href=\"https://bigbigtruck.itch.io/sweetabilene\">pdf</a> for pocket money.",
