        "title": "Apple releases iOS 27.2 RC for iPhone",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/apple-releases-ios-27-2-rc-for-iphone/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iOS-27.2-rc.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has released the first iOS 27.2 release candidate for iPhone. The update brings Apple’s next iPhone software release one step closer to its public launch.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios,ios-27,ios-27-2,iphone\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074777\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/apple-releases-ios-27-2-rc-for-iphone/#more-1074777\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
