        "title": "welcome to your longread",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214901/welcome-to-your-longread",
        "content_text": "Phil Christman has a <em>delightful</em> longread, <a href=\"https://philipchristman.substack.com/p/the-madness-of-roland\">The Madness of Roland</a>, a review of Tears for Fears' Roland Orzabal's memoir.  It's so fun.",
