        "title": "Ball in the Family",
        "url": "https://grantland.com/features/ball-in-the-family-austin-rivers-nba-doc-rivers-los-angeles-clippers/",
        "content_text": "How Austin Rivers, coached by his father on the Los Angeles Clippers, turned around his NBA career.",
