        "title": "Apple now selling repair parts for iPhone 18 Pro, latest Mac Studio and Mac mini models",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/20/apple-now-selling-repair-parts-for-iphone-18-pro-latest-mac-studio-and-mac-mini-models/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/08/DIY-Apple-device-repairs-now-fully-supported-in-Canada.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple today began selling repair parts for the iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max, as well as the M5 Max and M5 Ultra Mac Studio and the M6 or M5 Pro Mac mini models. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074910\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/20/apple-now-selling-repair-parts-for-iphone-18-pro-latest-mac-studio-and-mac-mini-models/#more-1074910\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
