        "title": "Apple’s new App Store rules crack down on AI nudification and ‘bait-and-switch’ apps",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/apples-new-app-store-rules-crack-down-on-ai-nudification-and-bait-and-switch-apps/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/apple-developer-11.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple updated its App Review Guidelines today with a series of changes meant to strengthen protections against harmful content and deceptive app review practices. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"app-store,apps\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074648\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/apples-new-app-store-rules-crack-down-on-ai-nudification-and-bait-and-switch-apps/#more-1074648\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
